Taken from the npm package qz-tray@2.2.5 with two changes:
- the node.js-only require('path') call in _qz.tools.absolute was removed so
  the file bundles for the browser without a node dependency;
- the export at the end sets module.exports before trying AMD define(), so the
  esbuild import always receives the qz object.
